==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Balrog (Enemy)|Balrog]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Kory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Save up money at the start because the tough enemies only appear on base hit. Due to Balrog's Single Attack, the best strategy is to send out many disposable attackers such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], including a few Wave Shield/Wave Immune cats like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] for the Kory.

